      "name": "RoRo Ferry Terminal Demo",
      "description": {
        "content": "This API deliver the enter and left event of the RoRo-Ferry-Terminal Rostock. It is no API key necessary. The look back is 48h.\r\nIt will be provides information about the Terminal Call itself, information's about the vessel in moment of arrival and depute as well as additional vessel information like length or call sigh.",
        "type": "text/plain"
      },
